# Performance

- Paginate lists; prefer cursor pagination for ledger.
- Index searchable columns and FKs.
- Avoid N+1; selective Prisma queries.
- Dynamic import heavy client-only widgets.
- Do not statically cache authenticated stock-sensitive pages incorrectly.
- Optimistic UI only where rollback is safe; stock posts should wait for server confirmation.
